BT 1 0 0 1 0 67 Tm .976154 Tw 15.5 TL /F1 10.5 Tf .062745 .094118 .156863 rg (JSON was chosen over a database because the amount of data is small and a plain file needs no) Tj T* 0 Tw .953141 Tw (setup. Amounts are rounded to two decimals and stored as numbers so totals add up exactly. The) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.205404 Tw (category must come from a fixed list, so the totals are not split across spellings such as ) Tj /F3 10.5 Tf (food) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.239251 Tw /F3 10.5 Tf (Foood) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf (. Validation lives in one place and runs before anything is saved, so a bad value can never) Tj T* 0 Tw (reach the file.) Tj T* ET
